00:01:52.320 --> 00:01:53.153
I'm like,

00:01:53.153 --> 00:01:54.129
"Yeah, that's him."

00:01:54.129 --> 00:01:55.084
(audience cheers)

00:01:55.084 --> 00:01:56.298
(Kelly claps)

00:01:56.298 --> 00:01:57.411
(Kelly laughs)

00:01:57.411 --> 00:01:58.307
- I love it.

00:01:58.307 --> 00:01:59.370
That's amazing.

00:01:59.370 --> 00:02:00.270
So Anabelle and Josie,

00:02:00.270 --> 00:02:01.500
I heard that you have a new cheer

00:02:01.500 --> 00:02:03.180
that you wanna share, right?

00:02:03.180 --> 00:02:04.260
- Yes.

00:02:04.260 --> 00:02:05.093
- All right!

00:02:05.093 --> 00:02:06.393
Let's see it!

00:02:06.393 --> 00:02:09.012
- One.
- One, two, three,

00:02:09.012 --> 00:02:10.470
Kelly!

00:02:10.470 --> 00:02:12.360
