00:02:12.360 --> 00:02:13.193
K-

00:02:13.193 --> 00:02:14.026
E-

00:02:14.026 --> 00:02:14.859
L-L-

00:02:14.859 --> 00:02:15.692
Y!

00:02:15.692 --> 00:02:16.565
That's right!

00:02:16.565 --> 00:02:18.340
Dance to it!

00:02:18.340 --> 00:02:19.783
Go Kelly!

00:02:19.783 --> 00:02:20.616
Go Kelly!

00:02:21.760 --> 00:02:23.147
Period!

00:02:23.147 --> 00:02:23.980
(audience cheers)

00:02:23.980 --> 00:02:26.457
