00:02:26.457 --> 00:02:27.797
- My God!

00:02:27.797 --> 00:02:29.130
I love you guys!

00:02:30.120 --> 00:02:31.470
Oh my gosh!

00:02:31.470 --> 00:02:32.820
I'm gonna watch that footage

00:02:32.820 --> 00:02:34.380
anytime I'm ever feeling down.

00:02:34.380 --> 00:02:35.910
That made me feel so good.

00:02:35.910 --> 00:02:36.900
Thank you ladies.

00:02:36.900 --> 00:02:38.784
Thank you Michael, Anabelle, Josie,

00:02:38.784 --> 00:02:40.500
I'm liking your post right now.

00:02:40.500 --> 00:02:41.430
I'm loving your family
(bell dings)

00:02:41.430 --> 00:02:43.050
